#: 74f68a07a77d46a890c84bc0bfb34521 of pybroker.slippage.FixedSlippageModel:3
msgid ""
"Buy fills are worsened upward; sell fills are worsened downward. Applies "
"to long entries, short entries, long exits, and covers."
